OL,3,GNEWSA'Devastating' ram raids could be
OL,4,Alinked ` police
OL,5,
OL,6,FA senior police officer has described a
OL,7,Frecent spate of ram raids as
OL,8,F"devastating for local communities" and
OL,9,Fsaid they may be linked.
OL,11,FCambridgeshire Police was called to
OL,12,Fthree incidents last week, in
OL,13,FCambridge, Whittlesey and Littleport.
OL,15,FDet Ch Insp Christian O'Brien said the
OL,16,Fforce was "looking at the possibility
OL,17,Fthat they are linked" and working "to
OL,18,Ffully understand the evidence that's
OL,19,Fbeen left at the scenes".
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
