OL,3,GNEWSA'Devastating' ram raids could be
OL,4,Alinked ` police
OL,5,
OL,6,F"These sorts of crimes are devastating
OL,7,Fto the local communities, to local
OL,8,Fbusinesses, and quite often these local
OL,9,Fbusinesses are the centre point of the
OL,10,Fcommunity," he said.
